{
  "name": "an address a draft or open role uses cannot be removed, and a closed role still says where it was",
  "description": "ADR-0024 decision 8 and the `address_in_use` and `address_removed` codes.\n\nRemoving an address is refused while a DRAFT or OPEN role uses it, with `roles` naming them, and allowed once only CLOSED roles do. Both halves matter. A draft about to be opened at an office that has just been retired would publish a place the company no longer has; an open role is immutable (ADR-0019 §13) and has already told people where the job is. A closed role, on the other hand, is history — it keeps pointing at the row, which is why removal is a stamp: the closed role below still renders Austin, now marked `removed`.\n\nAfter removal the address cannot be written onto a role again: `address_removed` on create, on a draft's PATCH and on revise, each naming the entry (`field: \"locations\"`, `position`, 1-based). A refused revise writes no successor.\n\n`roles` on `address_in_use` is `[{id, title, status}]`, oldest first, status draft or open — the only roles that block (amendment 1 §1.4).",
  "seed": ["principals"],
  "steps": [
    {
      "_step": "A DRAFT onsite at Austin.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001/roles",
        "body": {
          "title": "Austin field engineer",
          "engagement": "full_time",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "{{acme.address.austin}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "capture": {
        "draft": "$.id"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 201,
        "body": {
          "id": "<uuid>",
          "organization_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001",
          "status": "draft",
          "title": "Austin field engineer",
          "description": "",
          "engagement": "full_time",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "country": null,
              "address": {
                "id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-0000000ad002",
                "country": "US",
                "city": "Austin",
                "postal_code": "78701",
                "street1": "500 W 2nd St",
                "street2": "Suite 300",
                "is_main_office": false,
                "removed": false
              }
            }
          ],
          "currency": "",
          "yearly_ctc": null,
          "yearly_base": null,
          "hourly_rate": null,
          "expected_hours": null,
          "min_office_yoe": null,
          "min_oss_yoe": null,
          "requires_online_test": null,
          "max_interview_rounds": null,
          "avg_days_to_offer": null,
          "questions": [],
          "opened_at": null,
          "close_requested_at": null,
          "closed_at": null,
          "close_reason": null,
          "hires": [],
          "advertised": false,
          "supersedes": null,
          "created_at": "<timestamp>",
          "updated_at": "<timestamp>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
